"html":"local-derivation-from-read-proofs"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\">\\(A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1fcf344733aab173\" href=\"?note=1fcf344733aab173\" title=\"56-df-polynomial-interpretation\">56-df-polynomial-interpretation</a>。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall\\beta\\in A_2^V\\;(l^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta]&gt;r^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta])\">\\(\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall\\beta\\in A_2^V\\;(l^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta]&gt;r^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta])\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A_2,I_P,&gt;\\restriction A_2^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A_2,I_P,&gt;\\restriction A_2^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 6.2.9 后的终止推论，由 Theorem 6.2.2 实例化。自然数严格大于关系沿下降方向良基，PolyInt 提供全运算及逐参数严格单调，规则差值严格正给出兼容性。已核对这些适用条件及所引用定理的证明。原书特别给出忽略第二参数导致错误终止推断的反例；故不能把严格单调性省去。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.2; 6.2.9，印刷页 184–185; 188。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-polynomial-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"1fcf344733aab173","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-interpretation-termination","status":"resolved","id":"1a2313edea993f6b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-interpretation-termination]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-polynomial-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"1fcf344733aab173","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)$；$A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}$，$I_P$ 见 [[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]。假设 $\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall\\beta\\in A_2^V\\;(l^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta]>r^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta])$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)","display":false},{"tex":"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall\\beta\\in A_2^V\\;(l^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta]>r^{(A_2,I_P)}[\\beta])","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A_2,I_P,>\\restriction A_2^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R).","display":true}],"bytes":1632,"backlinks":[{"id":"17f62e88bfe3bea2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-polynomial-interpretation-termination.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1fcf344733aab173","1a2313edea993f6b"]}